     "body": "<p>Verified using the following label string: \"test with a&#13;&#10;newline\"</p>\n\n<p>FYI, &amp;#13 is carriage return (CR), &amp;#10 is line feed (LF).</p>\n\n<p>The following may be relevant: <a href=\"http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-xml/#sec-line-ends\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-xml/#sec-line-ends</a> (i.e. that XML parsers behave such that CRLF should be translated as LF and any CR not followed by LF be translated as LF)</p>",
     "created": "21/Aug/12 7:19 AM",
     "id": "12394",
     "jsdPublic": true,
